</section>
<section id="S4" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">4 </span>Conclusion</h2>

<div id="S4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We introduce an efficient framework that demonstrates the potential of constructing large-scale annotated datasets with LLMs and using them to train a performant supervised learning models at a very low cost,
which further advances vision-language alignment, leading to new state-of-the-art performance in zero-shot diagnosis, image-to-image, and image-to-report cross-modal retrieval with a 3D ResNet-18 through a vanilla CLIP training pipeline.
The success of our method suggests the potential of leveraging LLMs to faciliate more performant and scalable medical AI systems.</p>
</div>
<section id="S4.SS0.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
